This package contains no copies of CPython, uv, Ruff, PyO3, Cython, Jupyter,
tree-sitter, PyTorch, model weights, or GPU drivers. It discovers and, when
explicitly requested, delegates to an installed vu runtime artifact.

The referenced uv source is licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0. The referenced Ruff
source is licensed MIT. Their exact accepted source revisions and Cargo.lock
blob identifiers are recorded in toolchain.receipt.json. A discovered
PyTorch/Cython/Jupyter/tree-sitter installation remains governed by its own
distribution license and provenance.
